Description: Implements Generalized Canonical Correlation Analysis (GCCA)
    with missing values for multi-block omics integration (van de Velden
    and Takane, 2012). The package operates directly on HDF5 matrices via
    the BigDataStatMeth C++ API to scale computations; R functions are thin
    wrappers around the C++ core.
Depends: BiocStyle, BigDataStatMeth,  MASS, parallel, RSpectra, made4, 
    MultiAssayExperiment, R (>= 3.6.0), GenomeInfoDb
Imports: rlang (>= 1.1.0), Rcpp (>= 1.0.6), RcppEigen (>= 0.3.2.1.1),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen, Rhdf5lib, BigDataStatMeth, BH
